1
00:00:00,435 --> 00:00:03,145
(Bernadette:)So, when you said you wouldn't want
to spend that much time with me,

2
00:00:03,237 --> 00:00:05,777
(Bernadette:)it really hurt my feelings.

3
00:00:07,909 --> 00:00:10,149
(Howard:)I get that.
I'm so sorry.

4
00:00:10,278 --> 00:00:12,778
(Howard:)Starting tomorrow,
I am turning over a new leaf.

5
00:00:12,914 --> 00:00:15,524
(Howard:)Time with you is
my number one priority.

6
00:00:17,952 --> 00:00:19,332
(Bernadette:)Why tomorrow?

7
00:00:21,122 --> 00:00:25,162
(Howard:)Well, we're real close
to finishing off the new Batman game.

8
00:00:26,494 --> 00:00:29,334
(Raj:)It is awesome.

9
00:00:32,633 --> 00:00:33,943
(Raj:)You should probably go after her.

10
00:00:34,001 --> 00:00:36,001
(Howard:)Should I go after you?

11
00:00:36,137 --> 00:00:37,677
(Bernadette(off):)No!

12
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:41,880
(Howard:)Thanks for getting me in trouble.

13
00:00:45,713 --> 00:00:50,063
(Sheldon:)Amy.

14
00:00:52,987 --> 00:00:54,987
(Amy:)Sheldon, what are you doing here
so late?

15
00:00:55,123 --> 00:00:57,363
(Sheldon:)I couldn't sleep
because I kept thinking

